{"strongs": "H4999", "word": "נָוָה", "translit": "na.ah", "root": "נוה", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "pasture, meadow", "definition": "II. [ נָוָה ] noun feminine pasture, meadow ; — plural construct נְוֺת Zeph 2:6 , usually נְאוֺת Ps 23:2 + 11 t.; — 1. pasture, meadow: הָרֹעִים ׳ נ Amos 1:2 , compare Zeph 2:6 (|| גִּדְרוֺת צאֹן ; see also [ כָּרה ] p. 500 above); especially נְאוֺת (הַ)מִּדְבָּר Jer 9:9 ; Jer 23:10 ; Ps 65:13 ; Joel 1:19 ; Joel 1:20 ; Joel 2:22 דֶּשֶׁא ׳ נ Ps 23:2 grassy pastures ; אֱלֹהִים ׳ נ Ps 83:13 pastures of God , i.e. the land of Canaan, יַעֲקֹב ׳ נ Lam 2:2 הַשָּׁלוֺם ׳ נ Jer 25:37 meadows of pace ; חָמָס ׳ נ Ps 74:20 apparently habitations (?) of violence , but read probably ׳ גַּאֲוָה וְח , so Bi Che (see Ps 73:6 ). — Jer 6:2 see following; Job 8:6 see I. נָוֶה .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5047')\">BDB5047</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4999')\">H4999</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H5116')\">H5116</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5046')\">BDB5046</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5048')\">BDB5048</entry></div><p> II. [<bdbheb>נָוָה</bdbheb>] <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>pasture, meadow</highlightword>; — plural construct <bdbheb>נְוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 2:6\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(36,2,6)\">Zeph 2:6</ref>, usually <bdbheb>נְאוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 23:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,23,2)\">Ps 23:2</ref> + 11 t.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>pasture, meadow:</highlight> <bdbheb>הָרֹעִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 1:2\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(30,1,2)\">Amos 1:2</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Zeph 2:6\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(36,2,6)\">Zeph 2:6</ref> (|| <bdbheb>גִּדְרוֺת צאֹן</bdbheb>; see a